{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123657","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123657/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123657/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123657/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123657","id":5518799944,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEUWvQg","number":123657,"title":"Draw `CodeEdit` code completion over other controls","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-20T15:43:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T15:43:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123657","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123657.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123657.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104953\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7162\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7731\r\n- Fixes code hint getting cut off\r\n\r\n\r\nMakes CodeEdit code completion and code hint use `top_level` to draw over other controls.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1180\" height=\"297\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/680e64bd-5782-48ff-9df7-1dc6f91f65b3\" />\r\n\r\nThis also allows single height CodeEdits to use completion:\r\n<img width=\"547\" height=\"228\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24138ca8-fbfb-4701-b677-fe1eef2bac08\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe accessibility position is offset, but it otherwise works,\r\n- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123623\r\n\r\nIn some cases it would be better for it to be an actual Window. But there is currently no way to do that as far as I can tell due to Window issues.\r\n\r\nCode completion handles its own focusing now so I removed the editor code that makes sure it is focused. The panel gets the focus and it sends events to its parent CodeEdit (since its top level).\r\n\r\nFor android, if the keyboard is open I made the code completion bounded by the bottom of the CodeEdit, this is because ScriptEditor has android only code that expects the completion to stop at the bottom edge to ensure it is not behind the keyboard.\r\n\r\nPreviously, the completion position was determined when it was drawn, so `get_caret_draw_pos` (which updates on draw) worked fine. Now that the position is determined only when it is opened or updated, `get_caret_draw_pos` is out of date. I had to make some `_filter_code_completion_candidates_impl` calls deferred and add message queue waits in tests. \r\n- After https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121811, I can change it to be immediate.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123657/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123657/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}